{
  "situation": "DPA notified CSC that OpCo's AI chatbot vendor update exposed about 1,200 sessions over 3 days, returning other subscribers' billing address and call records; the vendor hosts model and logs outside UAE. CSC does not yet have IOCs, logs, or confirmation of whether cross-border hosting violates UAE data-localization rules.",
